/Title (Zero-day Android ransomware cannot be caught by signature-based antivirus, and the Android sandbox stops security tools from inspecting other apps. The one thing it cannot hide is its file-system behavior, so there is a need for a behavior-based early-warning detector that spots it quickly, limits file loss, and stops only the offending workload.)
